            <div class="feature">
                <img src="/images/technology.png" alt="Technology Icon">
                <h3>Technology Solutions</h3>
                <p>Our innovative tech helps in waste tracking and optimization.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <img src="/images/community.png" alt="Community Icon">
                <h3>Community Engagement</h3>
                <p>We believe in engaging communities to promote sustainability.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 RecycleConnect | <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a></p>
    </footer>

